    "2627": "The story-select constructor uses the typed draw-line and sound declarations. The call retains the draw group 0xA and original zero depth at 0x805DE528.",
    "2672": "The selector returns the signed slot query result and calls the native menu height and draw-line helpers. The original 206.0 height and zero depth are present.",
